WEBVTT

00:00:18.084 --> 00:00:22.122
Though you are so close,
Kore hodo soba ni

00:00:22.122 --> 00:00:26.626
I cannot tell you how I feel.
Iru no ni tsutaerarezu

00:00:26.626 --> 00:00:30.697
The more strongly I feel,
Tsuyoku omou hodo

00:00:30.697 --> 00:00:35.301
the harder it is for me to find the words.
Kotoba ga mitsukaranai

00:00:35.301 --> 00:00:43.343
What is sad is not fate...
Kanashii no wa unmei ja nakute

00:00:43.343 --> 00:00:54.117
...but that all encounters come to an end.
Deai no subete ni owari ga aru koto

00:00:54.521 --> 00:00:58.558
O incomplete beings,
Mikan naru mono

00:00:58.558 --> 00:01:02.996
awaken, for beyond the night...
mezameyo yoru o koetara

00:01:02.996 --> 00:01:07.067
At the end of the desert...
Sabaku no hate ni

00:01:07.067 --> 00:01:14.735
...the truth surely awaits you.
Shinjitsu ga matteru yo kitto

00:01:34.060 --> 00:01:35.687
What are you looking at?

00:01:37.797 --> 00:01:38.923
I was searching...

00:01:39.599 --> 00:01:42.033
For the route we'd take from here on out.

00:01:43.036 --> 00:01:43.900
Did you find it?

00:01:45.038 --> 00:01:48.064
I don't think I'll be able to
drive in a logical manner.

00:01:49.042 --> 00:01:50.669
You'll receive a scolding from Mr. Bogie.

00:01:51.845 --> 00:01:52.903
You're right.

00:01:53.246 --> 00:01:57.046
But I've decided on the path you chose for us.

00:01:57.917 --> 00:01:59.248
In pursuit of the wolf?

00:01:59.552 --> 00:02:03.545
I haven't thanked him properly
for saving Millie anyway.

00:02:04.190 --> 00:02:05.157
That is true.

00:02:05.525 --> 00:02:06.726
I came out here...

00:02:06.726 --> 00:02:10.924
...to show Millie the wondrous
things in the desert.

00:02:10.997 --> 00:02:13.864
That wolf and the Desert Fairy...

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:16.425
There's nothing more wondrous
than them, right?

00:02:17.003 --> 00:02:17.901
Let's go!

00:02:18.271 --> 00:02:23.140
Night of the Sandstorm

00:02:34.854 --> 00:02:36.515
It had already been 3 whole days.

00:02:36.656 --> 00:02:38.988
The tank forged on determinedly.

00:02:39.659 --> 00:02:43.254
But neither the Fairy nor
the wolf came into view.

00:02:44.664 --> 00:02:48.760
"Our heading should be correct,"
thought Honoka.

00:02:49.802 --> 00:02:53.169
It was as if that wolf was guiding her.

00:02:53.406 --> 00:02:57.206
For strangely, Honoka had a sense of certainty.

00:03:00.914 --> 00:03:02.905
A storm was approaching.

00:03:20.300 --> 00:03:21.665
Thanks for the food.

00:03:21.968 --> 00:03:23.401
Oh, it's okay, Millie.

00:03:23.870 --> 00:03:25.531
Let's wash them together later.

00:03:26.039 --> 00:03:26.596
Sure.

00:03:36.849 --> 00:03:41.149
There was still an awkward rift
between Honoka and Millie.

00:03:42.121 --> 00:03:45.024
Ever since that day when
Millie had been in danger,

00:03:45.024 --> 00:03:48.425
Honoka had almost never seen Millie smile.

00:03:52.165 --> 00:03:53.894
Except for that one time.

00:03:59.138 --> 00:04:00.506
Amazing...

00:04:00.506 --> 00:04:01.803
It's amazing!

00:04:01.874 --> 00:04:03.034
Isn't it, Hono?!

00:04:04.711 --> 00:04:05.268
Yeah.

00:04:06.212 --> 00:04:09.045
That time when she had taught
Millie how to shoot a gun,

00:04:09.916 --> 00:04:12.942
Millie definitely had a smile on her face then.

00:04:14.320 --> 00:04:16.481
It was a smile, to be sure...

00:04:34.474 --> 00:04:36.942
Looks like this is going to
become a full blown storm.

00:04:37.176 --> 00:04:38.473
Can we wait it out?

00:04:38.678 --> 00:04:40.270
We're in a bad position here.

00:04:40.346 --> 00:04:43.509
We'll go beyond the dune to the
left and see what the situation is.

00:04:43.883 --> 00:04:45.248
Okay, do it.

00:04:55.028 --> 00:04:57.019
We're going to make a short stop.

00:04:57.630 --> 00:04:59.621
With a sandstorm, it cannot be helped.

00:05:00.066 --> 00:05:01.294
Let's wait it out patiently.

00:05:03.469 --> 00:05:06.336
Millie, you need to be careful with that.

00:05:06.873 --> 00:05:09.398
Don't worry. I have the safety on.

00:05:17.784 --> 00:05:19.945
Iks, can I ask you something?

00:05:21.321 --> 00:05:22.151
What might it be?

00:05:22.755 --> 00:05:27.249
The other day, when we saw the Fairy,
you remember what you said?

00:05:30.163 --> 00:05:30.993
That's...

00:05:33.733 --> 00:05:34.893
The Star Seed...

00:05:36.636 --> 00:05:38.695
I clearly heard you say that.

00:05:39.038 --> 00:05:42.007
"Star Seed." What does it mean?

00:05:43.476 --> 00:05:48.436
Oh, that is, if it infringes on
your rules, that's okay...

00:05:48.848 --> 00:05:50.315
It's not that.

00:05:50.850 --> 00:05:53.182
I just don't know how to put it...

00:05:55.521 --> 00:05:57.887
Honoka, we'll standby here for now.

00:05:58.124 --> 00:06:00.786
We shouldn't have to go so far as
to use the electromagnetic shield.

00:06:00.893 --> 00:06:01.917
Got it.

00:06:02.028 --> 00:06:04.394
Oh, but for the container...

00:06:04.764 --> 00:06:06.026
What about the container?

00:06:09.235 --> 00:06:10.031
It's here.

00:06:10.503 --> 00:06:11.026
Yes.

00:06:21.047 --> 00:06:22.480
The Fairy's here?!

00:06:24.317 --> 00:06:25.306
I'm going to go take a look.

00:06:26.452 --> 00:06:27.851
Hono, take me too!

00:06:28.488 --> 00:06:31.218
You can't come, Millie.
The sandstorm's too severe.

00:06:31.591 --> 00:06:33.456
Please! Take me with you, Hono!

00:06:47.106 --> 00:06:47.834
Millie.

00:07:02.655 --> 00:07:04.282
No, it's not.

00:07:06.626 --> 00:07:07.786
This is not the place.

00:07:14.200 --> 00:07:17.499
Tell me, Iks. About what
you started to say earlier.

00:07:18.504 --> 00:07:24.377
She is... That Fairy is the seed of life,
who travels across the universe.

00:07:24.377 --> 00:07:25.935
The seed of life?

00:07:26.712 --> 00:07:28.648
In her body,

00:07:28.648 --> 00:07:31.818
she stores the genetic
information of all life forms...

00:07:31.818 --> 00:07:34.048
...and she will travel on to yet another world.

00:07:34.253 --> 00:07:35.720
What for?

00:07:36.122 --> 00:07:37.990
To take the life on this planet,

00:07:37.990 --> 00:07:42.188
and plant and nurture it on a new
planet that has just been born.

00:07:43.629 --> 00:07:44.687
Does that mean...

00:07:45.565 --> 00:07:48.167
...that this planet is nearing its end already?

00:07:48.167 --> 00:07:49.969
That everything's being
moved to another planet...

00:07:49.969 --> 00:07:52.369
...because it can't go on here anymore?

00:07:53.005 --> 00:07:55.337
What do you think?

00:07:59.946 --> 00:08:01.470
That can't be true.

00:08:02.348 --> 00:08:03.042
Yeah.

00:08:03.850 --> 00:08:05.852
I have no reason for it...

00:08:05.852 --> 00:08:08.343
...but that can't be true.

00:08:09.222 --> 00:08:12.714
I am sure it is so, then,
if that is what you believe.

00:08:19.131 --> 00:08:19.961
Hono.

00:08:21.567 --> 00:08:22.556
Over there.

00:08:29.275 --> 00:08:30.902
That wolf...

00:08:33.145 --> 00:08:35.409
The wolf was chasing after the Fairy...

00:08:36.549 --> 00:08:39.143
Right then, Honoka became certain of it.

00:08:39.952 --> 00:08:43.820
There was some sort of connection
between the Fairy and the wolf.

00:08:44.824 --> 00:08:49.022
Hono, I want to thank the wolf.

00:08:49.295 --> 00:08:50.057
Okay.

00:09:02.341 --> 00:09:04.309
Iks, look after Millie for me!

00:09:09.749 --> 00:09:11.774
Where are you?! Who fired those shots?!

00:09:28.734 --> 00:09:29.758
So you came.

00:09:32.004 --> 00:09:32.868
You...

00:09:33.673 --> 00:09:35.231
I said we'd meet again, didn't I?

00:09:35.841 --> 00:09:38.969
It's turned out exactly like I said, Sword Dancer.

00:09:40.346 --> 00:09:40.971
Leon.

00:09:41.681 --> 00:09:44.172
I'm honored that you remember me.

00:09:44.483 --> 00:09:46.815
You're the one who fired
those shots, aren't you?

00:09:47.086 --> 00:09:49.281
With prey before me, of course I'd shoot.

00:09:49.455 --> 00:09:52.219
Wasn't the Desert Fairy your prey?

00:09:52.391 --> 00:09:53.756
Why go after the wolf?

00:09:53.826 --> 00:09:57.421
You know, don't you? That's no ordinary wolf.

00:09:59.465 --> 00:10:01.228
It seems you've realized it, too.

00:10:03.936 --> 00:10:07.667
What I go after is my business. Isn't that right?

00:10:07.907 --> 00:10:10.569
Then I'll go about my own business, too.

00:10:10.843 --> 00:10:12.812
I won't let you kill the Fairy.

00:10:12.812 --> 00:10:14.143
Nor that wolf.

00:10:14.347 --> 00:10:15.507
Why not?

00:10:15.748 --> 00:10:18.911
I've got a little debt to repay. That's why.

00:10:19.151 --> 00:10:22.052
Are you going to demand
I put away my gun and leave?

00:10:23.823 --> 00:10:26.815
What will you do if I refuse?
Will you cut me down?

00:10:27.193 --> 00:10:29.495
It's not reason enough to kill each other.

00:10:29.495 --> 00:10:32.123
Would you just make yourself
scarce for the time being?

00:10:32.999 --> 00:10:35.126
Want me to give you a reason?

00:10:44.543 --> 00:10:46.712
If I say that I'll kill you,

00:10:46.712 --> 00:10:49.010
that'll be a respectable reason for you to fight.

00:10:49.815 --> 00:10:51.009
Am I wrong?

00:11:11.637 --> 00:11:12.433
Here goes.

00:11:17.443 --> 00:11:18.375
Didn't think you'd see through that.

00:11:28.320 --> 00:11:30.788
To think you would be so formidable...

00:11:30.890 --> 00:11:32.858
You've surprised me, Sword Dancer.

00:11:33.392 --> 00:11:35.360
You're... the Phantom!

00:11:35.928 --> 00:11:38.761
You've no right to talk about
me as if I'm some ghost.

00:11:39.131 --> 00:11:40.325
I am Leon!

00:11:45.337 --> 00:11:47.828
My body is a type of liquid metal!

00:11:47.973 --> 00:11:50.203
Can you cut through water, Sword Dancer?!

00:11:55.781 --> 00:11:57.681
An attack of that level won't...

00:12:01.187 --> 00:12:03.389
Honoka's fierce offensive looked as though...

00:12:03.389 --> 00:12:07.621
...it did not even give the liquid
metal body time to regenerate.

00:12:08.194 --> 00:12:09.058
However...

00:12:12.998 --> 00:12:13.521
I can do this!

00:12:35.254 --> 00:12:36.846
I didn't think you were this good.

00:12:39.625 --> 00:12:42.093
Damn... you...

00:12:48.300 --> 00:12:49.324
You.

00:13:03.149 --> 00:13:03.877
Miss Honoka!

00:13:04.483 --> 00:13:05.245
Miss Honoka!

00:13:06.719 --> 00:13:07.549
This is...

00:13:08.587 --> 00:13:10.111
Mr. Bogie, the airlock!

00:13:24.270 --> 00:13:25.828
Millie, get the scissors.

00:13:27.907 --> 00:13:28.635
Millie.

00:13:28.774 --> 00:13:30.298
What? Right!

00:13:41.754 --> 00:13:42.652
What's going on?

00:13:43.088 --> 00:13:45.022
Iks, report the situation to me.

00:13:45.090 --> 00:13:46.387
What got her?!

00:13:46.792 --> 00:13:49.317
These are... laser wounds.

00:13:49.595 --> 00:13:50.892
Laser, you say?

00:13:51.630 --> 00:13:53.029
There's no mistake.

00:13:53.499 --> 00:13:55.801
It wasn't a very powerful laser,

00:13:55.801 --> 00:13:58.804
but some of the capillaries
have been burnt through.

00:13:58.804 --> 00:14:01.170
Are you saying that man had
it hidden on his person?

00:14:02.274 --> 00:14:04.643
He must have metamorphosed his own body...

00:14:04.643 --> 00:14:06.907
...and created a laser firing apparatus.

00:14:07.479 --> 00:14:08.707
That's absurd...

00:14:09.882 --> 00:14:13.219
Iks, Hono won't die, will she?

00:14:13.219 --> 00:14:15.278
You'll be able to make her better, right?

00:14:17.823 --> 00:14:21.520
In place of a smile, upon his
face were tension and agitation.

00:14:22.428 --> 00:14:27.764
They spoke in absolute terms that
Honoka's condition was grave.

00:14:29.001 --> 00:14:29.899
Hono...

00:14:33.739 --> 00:14:34.728
Hono...

00:14:35.641 --> 00:14:37.108
Iks, how is she?

00:14:37.576 --> 00:14:39.100
Her wounds are too deep.

00:14:39.645 --> 00:14:41.280
With my powers alone,

00:14:41.280 --> 00:14:42.781
though I may be able to restore her tissue,

00:14:42.781 --> 00:14:44.583
creating blood is beyond my abilities.

00:14:44.583 --> 00:14:46.141
She will need a blood transfusion.

00:14:47.853 --> 00:14:49.616
What about a hospital?! Take her to a hospital!

00:14:50.990 --> 00:14:53.359
Even if we turn back to an
area with medical facilities,

00:14:53.359 --> 00:14:54.383
it'll take at least 5 days.

00:14:54.927 --> 00:14:56.792
No matter how we hurried...

00:14:57.396 --> 00:15:00.126
No... No...

00:15:01.467 --> 00:15:02.866
To think such a thing would...

00:15:03.602 --> 00:15:07.470
At times, silence can be more
poignant than loud noise.

00:15:08.140 --> 00:15:09.775
They wanted even the tiniest bit of hope...

00:15:09.775 --> 00:15:12.645
They wanted words of salvation,

00:15:12.645 --> 00:15:16.843
but a person who could say those
words was nowhere to be found.

00:15:24.857 --> 00:15:25.653
Mr. Bogie.

00:15:26.058 --> 00:15:26.990
What is it?

00:15:27.559 --> 00:15:28.958
Please open the airlock.

00:15:29.094 --> 00:15:29.753
What?

00:15:30.963 --> 00:15:31.759
Please.

00:15:48.914 --> 00:15:50.006
The wolf?

00:15:52.017 --> 00:15:54.577
You are called Kamui, aren't you?

00:15:54.853 --> 00:15:55.820
Kamui?

00:15:56.021 --> 00:15:57.511
Is that the wolf's name?

00:16:02.928 --> 00:16:03.986
Please.

00:16:23.215 --> 00:16:24.375
What are you doing?!

00:16:25.951 --> 00:16:27.077
Stop him!

00:16:27.319 --> 00:16:28.946
What do you think you're doing to Honoka?!

00:16:29.488 --> 00:16:30.420
Mr. Bogie.

00:16:30.723 --> 00:16:32.020
Make him stop!

00:16:32.257 --> 00:16:33.246
Mr. Bogie,

00:16:34.193 --> 00:16:37.356
I never imagined I would
say such a thing to you,

00:16:38.430 --> 00:16:39.362
but please calm down.

00:16:42.201 --> 00:16:43.793
Though, I can hardly blame you.

00:16:45.504 --> 00:16:50.142
In truth, even Iks did not clearly
grasp the significance...

00:16:50.142 --> 00:16:51.973
...of what was happening right then.

00:16:52.945 --> 00:16:54.680
He merely had no choice...

00:16:54.680 --> 00:16:59.083
...but to pin their last faint hope
on this intelligent beast.

00:17:50.202 --> 00:17:51.499
Come on out.

00:17:58.343 --> 00:18:00.607
Looks like you're the so-called Phantom.

00:18:01.647 --> 00:18:05.105
Just like I thought, you seem to be
a member of the Monster Troop.

00:18:05.484 --> 00:18:07.384
Monster Troop?

00:18:07.953 --> 00:18:11.514
Literally a military unit of monsters, if you will.

00:18:11.857 --> 00:18:15.127
It is the name of a special forces unit...

00:18:15.127 --> 00:18:18.688
...composed of combat cyborgs
and the like during the Great War.

00:18:18.964 --> 00:18:20.032
That guy...

00:18:20.032 --> 00:18:23.695
Are you saying that man,
Leon or something, is one of them?

00:18:24.236 --> 00:18:28.639
Considering how he fought,
I think we can safely say that he is.

00:18:33.579 --> 00:18:34.807
What's wrong?

00:18:35.114 --> 00:18:36.638
Curious about me?

00:18:42.454 --> 00:18:44.149
I'm like this, too.

00:18:45.090 --> 00:18:48.389
The being called the Phantom
is likely of the same ilk.

00:18:48.927 --> 00:18:51.122
They do not know death.

00:18:51.230 --> 00:18:53.164
Are you saying they're immortal?

00:18:53.799 --> 00:18:54.925
Oh-ho...

00:18:55.934 --> 00:18:59.071
To be sure, their structure
will deteriorate over time...

00:18:59.071 --> 00:19:01.640
...and they'll probably lose
their ability to think as well,

00:19:01.640 --> 00:19:03.904
but they will not die even then.

00:19:08.814 --> 00:19:10.916
So you can't talk.

00:19:10.916 --> 00:19:13.552
Reduced ability to control shape...

00:19:13.552 --> 00:19:17.511
No, the problem is with the center
of thought and communication...

00:19:18.090 --> 00:19:20.320
So you've become wild...

00:19:21.126 --> 00:19:24.186
Okay, we've met at the perfect time.

00:19:24.963 --> 00:19:29.263
I was just looking to increase
the density of my nanomachines.

00:19:37.309 --> 00:19:39.444
You think you can...

00:19:39.444 --> 00:19:40.468
...escape from me?

00:19:47.085 --> 00:19:49.713
Trying to spit out my arm is useless.

00:19:50.155 --> 00:19:52.624
It's begun to assimilate you from within.

00:19:52.624 --> 00:19:55.957
Do you understand?
You're going to become me.

00:19:56.795 --> 00:20:00.891
But he maintained a completely human form.

00:20:01.066 --> 00:20:03.068
If he's a relic from an era gone by,

00:20:03.068 --> 00:20:05.536
you'd think he would be in
a more deteriorated state.

00:20:06.104 --> 00:20:09.274
The liquid metal that makes up their bodies...

00:20:09.274 --> 00:20:11.970
...should be regulated by nanomachines.

00:20:12.678 --> 00:20:15.909
Increasing their density can
suppress deterioration.

00:20:16.081 --> 00:20:21.041
But with that technology lost to us now,
that can't be so easy...

00:20:21.253 --> 00:20:23.922
No, there is an easy way.

00:20:23.922 --> 00:20:25.583
An easy way?

00:20:27.926 --> 00:20:29.325
Good choice.

00:20:32.898 --> 00:20:35.400
By assimilating another of its kind...

00:20:35.400 --> 00:20:37.300
By devouring another of its kind,

00:20:40.239 --> 00:20:44.300
they can maintain their functionality perfectly.

00:20:44.810 --> 00:20:47.335
However, if one were able to assimilate...

00:20:47.913 --> 00:20:51.405
...a more efficient life form
from a higher dimension...

00:20:53.051 --> 00:20:54.916
And that's the Fairy...

00:21:03.161 --> 00:21:04.890
Just as I expected.

00:21:05.130 --> 00:21:07.098
My reaction time's improved.

00:21:08.734 --> 00:21:12.670
Sword Dancer, I've grown even stronger now!

00:21:13.071 --> 00:21:15.539
Are you still alive, Sword Dancer?!

00:21:15.774 --> 00:21:17.743
If you're alive, don't you die!

00:21:17.743 --> 00:21:20.234
You're my main dish!

00:21:24.583 --> 00:21:25.413
Hono...

00:21:41.300 --> 00:21:44.633
The long stormy night wore on...

00:21:52.978 --> 00:21:56.381
An intersection waiting for morning...
Asa o matteiru kousaten ga

00:21:56.381 --> 00:22:00.419
...cradling an abandoned cat that wandered in.
Mayoikonda sute-neko o daiteiru

00:22:00.419 --> 00:22:03.021
Red and green and yellow.
Aka to ao to kiiro

00:22:03.021 --> 00:22:06.115
It is simply gentle.
Sore wa tada yasashii

00:22:06.692 --> 00:22:10.195
Stopping just after dawn,
Akegata-sugi ni furiyanda

00:22:10.195 --> 00:22:14.132
a misty rain made a screen of water.
Kosame ga tsukutta mizu no sukuriin ga

00:22:14.132 --> 00:22:16.735
Until that time when it dries,
Kawaku sono toki made

00:22:16.735 --> 00:22:19.829
it is simply gentle.
Sore wa tada yasashii

00:22:20.005 --> 00:22:23.408
More than small coincidences like that,
Sonna chiisana guuzen yori mo

00:22:23.408 --> 00:22:26.878
the fact that you are there...
Kimi ga soko ni iru koto ga

00:22:26.878 --> 00:22:30.115
...cannot be a small thing, I think.
Chiisai hazu ga nai to omounda

00:22:30.115 --> 00:22:33.949
Even though it's obvious.
Atarimae nandakedo

00:22:35.620 --> 00:22:42.461
It must be sad not to have anyone.
Daremo inai to kanashii koto deshou

00:22:42.461 --> 00:22:49.162
Now, come on out to where the sun is shining.
Saa hi no ataru basho e dete-oide

00:22:49.234 --> 00:22:56.041
Even the several incidents that trouble you...
Kimi o komaraseru ikutsuka no dekigoto mo

00:22:56.041 --> 00:23:01.240
...are coincidences of yesterdays past.
Kinou izen no guuzen nanda yo

00:23:03.014 --> 00:23:08.884
Though, I'm sure you actually know that already.
Hontou wa wakatteru to omou kedo

00:23:15.160 --> 00:23:16.889
Preview

00:23:17.062 --> 00:23:19.496
I hover between life and death.

00:23:20.098 --> 00:23:20.894
But...

00:23:21.233 --> 00:23:23.098
...the fight isn't over yet.

00:23:23.769 --> 00:23:25.794
I have to protect Kamui and the Fairy.

00:23:26.271 --> 00:23:28.296
I have to stand up against Leon.

00:23:29.107 --> 00:23:31.076
I have neither the strength to fight,

00:23:31.076 --> 00:23:33.510
nor any hope of winning,

00:23:34.513 --> 00:23:35.377
but...

00:23:36.114 --> 00:23:39.880
Next time on
The Third - The Girl With The Blue Eye,

00:23:40.018 --> 00:23:42.053
episode 16, "Life Dancing Wildly".

00:23:42.053 --> 00:23:43.221
Life Dancing Wildly
episode 16, "Life Dancing Wildly".

00:23:43.221 --> 00:23:44.916
Life Dancing Wildly
